{"duration": 38.532, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "Sir John Franklin forces his men to chew raw seal blubber on ice.", "start": 0.08, "end": 3.688}, {"beat": 1, "text": "The crew grumbles, calling the order madness.", "start": 4.109, "end": 6.341}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Some swear they\u2019ll starve before they swallow any more animal fat.", "start": 6.561, "end": 9.614}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Ice traps the ships for months.", "start": 10.034, "end": 11.546}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Rations run low, and every day the men grow weaker.", "start": 11.766, "end": 14.634}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it\u2019s like skipping breakfast and the only snack left is a greasy doughnut.", "start": 15.054, "end": 19.272}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Seal blubber is dense with calories and fat, the same fuel seals use to survive long fasts.", "start": 19.692, "end": 25.102}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Those calories replace missing meat, and the thick fat slows body\u2011heat loss in sub\u2011zero air.", "start": 25.322, "end": 30.39}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Ironically, the blubber could not replace the lost vitamin\u202fC and thiamine, so scurvy and beri\u2011beri still claimed the crew.", "start": 30.81, "end": 37.412}], "words": [{"w": "Sir", "start": 0.167, "end": 0.267, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "John", "start": 0.292, "end": 0.542, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Franklin", "start": 0.592, "end": 0.992, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "forces", "start": 1.067, "end": 1.392, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "his", "start": 1.417, "end": 1.542, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "men", "start": 1.592, "end": 1.917, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "to", "start": 1.967, "end": 2.042, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "chew", "start": 2.092, "end": 2.317, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "raw", "start": 2.367, "end": 2.592, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "seal", "start": 2.667, "end": 2.892, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "blubber", "start": 2.942, "end": 3.217, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "on",